      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New to market with Tony Donnelly of Leonard Wilson Keenan \r\n\r\nThis superb  5-bedroom detached bungalow at Churchtown Lodge, Churchtown, Co. Kildare is an exceptional spacious family home. Occupying a private, generous site, the property boasts a fantastic attic conversion and a large detached garage/workshop, making it ideal for a growing family looking for versatility, comfort, and independence.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n\r\n•\tSpacious Living: Detached bungalow design offering easy single-level living options with a spacious, flowing layout.\r\n•\tVersatile Attic Conversion: That includes two double bedrooms and a bathroom.\r\n•\tDetached Garage: Offers excellent extra storage, workshop potential, or a secure area for a classic car.\r\n•\tPrime Location: Situated in the peaceful setting of Churchtown, just a short distance from Athy town and all amenities, schools, shops, train station swimming pool and quick access to commuter routes.\r\n\r\nProperty Layout\r\n\r\nGround Floor\r\n\r\n•\tEntrance Hall: Bright, welcoming entrance hallway providing clear separation between living and bedroom spaces.\r\n•\tLiving & Dining: Spacious rear extension with main lounge featuring large windows that flood the room with natural light, alongside an interconnected kitchen and dining space, laundry/utility room with shower unit and back hall and door to the rear garden area.\r\n\r\n•\tAdditional Bedrooms: Three further double bedrooms offering flexible accommodation options for family members or guests.\r\n\r\n•\tFamily Bathroom: A centrally located bathroom  with separate shower unit.\r\n\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\n•\tAttic Conversion: Accessed via a permanent staircase, this expansive, bright space features overhead skylights, creating an incredibly adaptable environment to fit your family’s unique needs.\r\nExterior  \r\n\r\n•\tGardens & Grounds: The rear of the property features mature trees & shrubs and a south facing cobble lock patio area.\r\n•\tSecure parking Accessed via electric gates with tarmacadam drive \r\n•\tDetached Garage: Positioned to the side, providing ample secure parking and extra utility storage space.\r\n\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
